Package: libatk1.0-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBATK_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/atk
Depends: libatk1.0-0 (= @DEB_LIBATK_V@), libglib2.0-dev
Description: Development files for the ATK accessibility toolkit
 ATK is a toolkit providing accessibility interfaces for applications or other
 toolkits.
 .
 This package contains the development headers, static libraries and
 pkg-config files needed to build software that uses ATK.
